For specific [[Trinket]] recommendations, here are some possible combinations:

====Survivability====
*'''{{TI|Pink Bow|name=true}}/Options'''
**This Trinket enables Connie to outrun some Twisteds before [[Panic Mode]] {{Small|(21.5 run speed)}}. Here are some options to pair Pink Bow with;
***'''{{TI|Speedy Shoes|name=true}}''', to further increase Run Speed {{Small|(22.6 run speed)}}, making her be able to outrun all average speed Twisteds even on Panic Mode, albeit by a tiny amount;
***'''{{TI|Vanity Mirror|name=true}}''', to be able to outrun every Twisted except {{CI|Twisted Pebble|name=true}} during Panic Mode {{Small|(27.9 run speed)}};
***'''{{TI|Train Whistle|name=true}}''', to completely nullify the {{Debuff|Slow|}} Debuff, making {{CI|Twisted Vee|name=true}} significantly easier to survive;
***'''{{TI|Peppermint Icing|name=true}}''', to give her a bit of extra Stamina to get to a safe spot away from Twisteds while invisible;
***'''{{TI|Star Pillow|name=true}}''', to regenerate [[Stamina]] faster while extracting, taking advantage of her average Stamina and fast extraction;
***The Trinkets listed in the '''Extraction''' section, to help with Floor progression; etc.

====Extraction====
*'''{{TI|Magnifying Glass|name=true}}/Options'''
**This Trinket allows Connie to take full advantage over her 4{{Star}} [[Extraction Speed]] {{Small|(1.2 extraction speed)}} and 2 Star [[Skill Check]] {{Small|(67 skill check size)}}. Here are some options to pair Magnifying Glass with:
***'''{{TI|Vee's Remote|name=true}}''', to allow for quicker Floor progression, especially if teammates also carry Vee's Remote;
***'''{{TI|Participation Award|name=true}}''', to speed up [[Machine]] completion by maximizing Skill Check extraction. However, it leaves you with a near 1{{Star}} Window Size {{Small|(24.19 avg/21.51 with Tech Savvy)}};
***'''{{TI|Thinking Cap|name=true}}''', to increase [[Skill Check]] size, helping you hit your Skill Checks easier if you struggle with such;
***'''{{TI|Mime Makeup|name=true}}''', to avoid attracting Twisteds to your location when you miss a Skill Check, also helps if you desire to complete [[Dyle's Floor]] at ease;
***Any Trinkets listed in the '''Survivability/Mobility''' section, to help with survival.

====Ability====
